24 pb-24 sm:pt-32 sm:pb-32"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20"><div class=""><div class="relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-lg px-6 py-12 sm:px-10 sm:py-16 bg-btn-primary-bg text-white"><div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-white opacity-75"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="size-full object-cover object-center" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcontact-cta-1.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcontact-cta-1.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcontact-cta-1.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75"/><div class="absolute inset-0 mix-blend-multiply bg-btn-primary-bg/90"></div></div><div class="relative flex max-w-md flex-col items-center text-center"><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">Modernizing Wall St.</h3><p class="mt-4">Reimagining financial market data for the 21st century.</p><div class="mt-6"><a href="/about" target="_self" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md px-8 py-3 text-sm font-medium bg-btn-primary-bg text-white hover:bg-btn-primary-bg-hover">About Massive</a></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-lg px-6 py-12 sm:px-10 sm:py-16 bg-btn-primary-bg text-white"><div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-white opacity-75"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="size-full object-cover object-center" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcontact-cta-2.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcontact-cta-2.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcontact-cta-2.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75"/><div class="absolute inset-0 mix-blend-multiply bg-btn-primary-bg/90"></div></div><div class="relative flex max-w-md flex-col items-center text-center"><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">Schedule a demo</h3><p class="mt-4">Talk with our market data experts</p><div class="mt-6"><a href="https://calendly.com/massive-com/discovery-call" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md px-8 py-3 text-sm font-medium bg-btn-primary-bg text-white hover:bg-btn-primary-bg-hover">Calendly</a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="_S_2_" class="overflow-x-clip bg-white py-24 sm:py-32"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20"><div class=""><div class="text-left lg:pr-8 mb-8"><h2 class="font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white text-pretty text-3xl sm:text-4xl">Recommended</h2><div class="mt-6 leading-8 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 text-lg">Can&#x27;t find the answer you&#x27;re looking for?<!-- --> <a class="text-link hover:text-link-hover font-medium" href="/contact">Contact our team</a>.</div></div></div><div class=""><div><ul class="divide-y divide-gray-100"><li class="py-8 first:pt-0"><dl class="relative flex flex-wrap gap-x-3"><dt class="sr-only">Title</dt><dd class="w-full flex-none text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900"><a href="https://massive.com/knowledge-base/article/are-all-indices-available-through-the-basic-subscription-tier">Are all indices available through the basic subscription tier?</a></dd><div><dt class="sr-only">Data Coverage Category</dt><dd class="mt-2 flex-none text-base leading-7 text-gray-600"><a class="flex h-6 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-blue-100 px-2 py-1" href="https://massive.com/knowledge-base/categories/data-coverage"><p class="text-center text-xs leading-none font-medium text-blue-800">Data Coverage</p></a></dd></div><div><dt class="sr-only">Indices Category</dt><dd class="mt-2 flex-none text-base leading-7 text-gray-600"><a class="flex h-6 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-blue-100 px-2 py-1" href="https://massive.com/knowledge-base/categories/indices"><p class="text-center text-xs leading-none font-medium text-blue-800">Indices</p></a></dd></div><dt class="sr-only">Description</dt><dd class="mt-2 w-full flex-none text-base leading-7 text-gray-600">No, and the ones it withholds are the famous ones: SPX, DJI, RUT and VIX all need a paid tier. Basic still reaches more than 10,000 of the 13,000-odd indices Massive publishes, and NDX and the Nasdaq Composite are among them.</dd></dl></li><li class="py-8 first:pt-0"><dl class="relative flex flex-wrap gap-x-3"><dt class="sr-only">Title</dt><dd class="w-full flex-none text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900"><a href="https://massive.com/knowledge-base/article/does-massive-offer-dark-pool-data">Does Massive offer dark pool data?</a></dd><div><dt class="sr-only">Data Coverage Category</dt><dd class="mt-2 flex-none text-base leading-7 text-gray-600"><a class="flex h-6 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-blue-100 px-2 py-1" href="https://massive.com/knowledge-base/categories/data-coverage"><p class="text-center text-xs leading-none font-medium text-blue-800">Data Coverage</p></a></dd></div><div><dt class="sr-only">Stocks Category</dt><dd class="mt-2 flex-none text-base leading-7 text-gray-600"><a class="flex h-6 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-blue-100 px-2 py-1" href="https://massive.com/knowledge-base/categories/stocks"><p class="text-center text-xs leading-none font-medium text-blue-800">Stocks</p></a></dd></div><dt class="sr-only">Description</dt><dd class="mt-2 w-full flex-none text-base leading-7 text-gray-600">Yes. Off-exchange prints, which include dark pool executions, arrive on the ordinary trades feed and are identified by an exchange ID of 4. There is no separate dark pool endpoint, and no way to tell which individual venue a print came from.</dd></dl></li><li class="py-8 first:pt-0"><dl class="relative flex flex-wrap gap-x-3"><dt class="sr-only">Title</dt><dd class="w-full flex-none text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900"><a href="https://massive.com/knowledge-base/article/does-massive-offer-pre-market-and-after-hours-data">Does Massive offer pre-market and after-hours data?</a></dd><div><dt class="sr-only">FAQ Category</dt><dd class="mt-2 flex-none text-base leading-7 text-gray-600"><a class="flex h-6 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-blue-100 px-2 py-1" href="https://massive.com/knowledge-base/categories/faq"><p class="text-center text-xs leading-none font-medium text-blue-800">FAQ</p></a></dd></div><div><dt class="sr-only">Stocks Category</dt><dd class="mt-2 flex-none text-base leading-7 text-gray-600"><a class="flex h-6 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-blue-100 px-2 py-1" href="https://massive.com/knowledge-base/categories/stocks"><p class="text-center text-xs leading-none font-medium text-blue-800">Stocks</p></a></dd></div><dt class="sr-only">Description</dt><dd class="mt-2 w-full flex-none text-base leading-7 text-gray-600">Yes. Every extended-hours trade and quote is published, from 04:00 to 20:00 Eastern. There is no session parameter, so you select a session with timestamps, and expect far fewer aggregate bars outside regular hours because most extended-hours trades do not update a bar.</dd></dl></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><script>$RB=[];$RV=function(a){$RT=performance.now();for(var b=0;b<a.length;b+=2){var c=a[b],e=a[b+1];null!==e.parentNode&&e.parentNode.removeChild(e);var f=c.parentNode;if(f){var g=c.previousSibling,h=0;do{if(c&&8===c.nodeType){var d=c.data;if("/$"===d||"/&"===d)if(0===h)break;else h--;else"$"!==d&&"$?"!==d&&"$~"!==d&&"$!"!==d&&"&"!==d||h++}d=c.nextSibling;f.removeChild(c);c=d}while(c);for(;e.firstChild;)f.insertBefore(e.firstChild,c);g.data="$";g._reactRetry&&requestAnimationFrame(g._reactRetry)}}a.length=0};
